
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>For My Baby 💗</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    background: #ffd6e7;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
}

.container {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
}

h2 {
    color: #d63384;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.envelope {
    width: 300px;
    height: 190px;
    background: #ff8fba;
    border-radius: 10px;
    position: relative;
    margin: auto;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px #d96b9980;
}

.envelope::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    border-left: 150px solid transparent;
    border-right: 150px solid transparent;
    border-top: 110px solid #ffb2ce;
    z-index: 2;
}

.heart {
    font-size: 40px;
    position: absolute;
    top: 75px;
    left: 130px;
    z-index: 3;
}

.letter {
    display: none;
    background: #fff0f5;
    width: 320px;
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    margin: auto;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 20px #d96b9950;
    color: #a83265;
    line-height: 1.7;
    animation: open 1s ease;
}

.letter h2 {
    color: #e75480;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.letter p {
    font-size: 15px;
    text-align: left;
}

.signature {
    text-align: right;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-style: italic;
}

button {
    background: #e75480;
    color: white;
    border: none;
    padding: 12px 25px;
    border-radius: 25px;
    margin-top: 25px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 15px;
}

button:hover {
    background: #d63384;
}

@keyframes open {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }
}

.hidden {
    display: none;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h2>💗 A Little Letter For You 💗</h2>

    <div class="envelope" id="envelope">
        <div class="heart">💌</div>
    </div>

    <button id="openBtn" onclick="openLetter()">
        Open My Letter 💗
    </button>

    <div class="letter" id="letter">

        <h2>Hii Jah Baby Ko! 💗</h2>

        <p>
        My HONN!! THANKYOUU FOR 1 MONTH!
        YESS, 1 MONTH JAHH! 🥹💗
        <br><br>

        Salamatt po sa iyong binigay na alaga,
        time, at pagmamahal po. Buti na lang
        nalagpasan natin ito. I'm so happy
        na umabot tayo sa ganito.
        <br><br>

        I hope na mas marami pa tayong
        months and memories na pagsasaluhan.
        Sana kahit may mga pagsubok,
        piliin pa rin nating intindihin
        at mahalin ang isa't isa.
        <br><br>

        Thank you for being part of my life.
        I appreciate you so much, baby!
        I LOVE YOUU SO MUCHH! 💗
        </p>

        <div class="signature">
            Forever yours,<br>
            Your Baby 💕
        </div>

    </div>

</div>

<script>
function openLetter() {
    document.getElementById("envelope").classList.add("hidden");
    document.getElementById("openBtn").classList.add("hidden");
    document.getElementById("letter").style.display = "block";
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
<img src="jah.jpg" class="photo" alt="Our picture">.photo {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 250px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    border: 4px solid #ffb6d0;
    display: block;
    margin: 15px auto;
}
